        "heading": "How has Chevron Usa's federal obligation level changed recently?",
        "body": "Chevron Usa obligated $339M in FY2026 to date, up 46.7% year over year. Chevron Usa obligations increased steadily from $55.8M in FY21 to $116M in FY22 and $180M in FY23, dipped to $132M in FY24, then rose to $231M in FY25 before reaching $339M in FY26. The award count for FY2026 to date is 85, with an average award size of $4M. These figures show the current fiscal-year totals are partial and reflect ongoing contracting activity."
      },
